{"vid":"08bahngAat4","source":"08bahngAat4.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3,"txt":"60% of Canadian workers are in jobs that"},{"t":5.6,"txt":"will be affected by AI, but that doesn't"},{"t":8.4,"txt":"mean 60% of jobs are disappearing. 31%"},{"t":11.7,"txt":"of workers are in jobs with high"},{"t":13.3,"txt":"exposure and low complementary roles,"},{"t":15.8,"txt":"meaning many tasks could be automated."},{"t":18.6,"txt":"About 29% are in high exposure but high"},{"t":22,"txt":"complementary roles, where AI is more"},{"t":24.4,"txt":"likely to assist rather than replace."},{"t":27.3,"txt":"And 40% are in lower exposure roles,"},{"t":30.5,"txt":"which suggests that their roles won't be"},{"t":32.6,"txt":"heavily impacted by AI. This data shows"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"us that AI doesn't affect all jobs"},{"t":37.4,"txt":"equally. The biggest changes tend to"},{"t":39.4,"txt":"show up in roles with more repetitive or"},{"t":41.4,"txt":"standardized tasks in areas such as"},{"t":43.9,"txt":"administrative work, finance and data"},{"t":46,"txt":"processing, logistics and scheduling,"},{"t":48.5,"txt":"and basic customer service. These are"},{"t":50.6,"txt":"roles where AI tools can create"},{"t":52.3,"txt":"efficiencies by automating routine tasks"},{"t":55.2,"txt":"like data entry, summarizing"},{"t":57.2,"txt":"information, and optimizing workflows."},{"t":60,"txt":"At the same time, jobs that rely heavily"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"on human judgment, in-person"},{"t":64.4,"txt":"communication, and creative direction,"},{"t":66.8,"txt":"they are much harder to automate."},{"t":69.1,"txt":"Speaking of, use your human judgment to"},{"t":71.7,"txt":"like and subscribe."},{"t":73.3,"txt":"AI is increasingly appearing in the"},{"t":75.2,"txt":"hiring process."},{"t":77,"txt":"I might be AI."},{"t":79.2,"txt":"I'm not."},{"t":81,"txt":"Or am I?"},{"t":83.3,"txt":"But in a study conducted by Indeed,"},{"t":85.2,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":85.2,"txt":">> over 25% of hiring managers in Canada"},{"t":87.8,"txt":"say that they are using AI in"},{"t":89.9,"txt":"recruitment. Sometimes the first step in"},{"t":92.4,"txt":"an interview process is a chat with an"},{"t":94.7,"txt":"AI interviewer. Many companies are"},{"t":96.9,"txt":"adding AI video to the beginning of"},{"t":98.8,"txt":"their interview process, in which an AI"},{"t":100.9,"txt":"tool will ask questions and provide time"},{"t":103.7,"txt":"for you to respond. But, if you're"},{"t":105.6,"txt":"following our other videos on virtual"},{"t":108,"txt":"and AI interviews, you'll have exactly"},{"t":110.1,"txt":"what it takes to make it to that next"},{"t":111.7,"txt":"round. Now, an AI interview may also"},{"t":114.1,"txt":"take the form of a a conversation. In"},{"t":116.5,"txt":"best practice, the notes are reviewed by"},{"t":118.6,"txt":"a human who has the final say."},{"t":120.8,"txt":"While not all hiring teams have adopted"},{"t":123,"txt":"this screening, you may encounter it at"},{"t":125.1,"txt":"larger companies that get a lot of"},{"t":126.8,"txt":"applications. So, you've made it past"},{"t":129.4,"txt":"the initial screening and"},{"t":132.3,"txt":">> [laughter]"},{"t":134.3,"txt":">> will now be talking face-to-face with"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"someone from the hiring team. Congrats."},{"t":138.6,"txt":"Your interviewer may lean on AI to"},{"t":141.1,"txt":"transcribe the interview, so they don't"},{"t":143.1,"txt":"have to worry about taking notes."},{"t":145.4,"txt":"Instead, they can review the transcripts"},{"t":147.8,"txt":"to refer back to something you said or"},{"t":149.8,"txt":"share the transcript with another team"},{"t":151.6,"txt":"member who wasn't present for the"},{"t":153.1,"txt":"interview. From the HR department to the"},{"t":155.4,"txt":"rest of the company, the shift in AI use"},{"t":157.8,"txt":"is already happening in Canadian"},{"t":159.4,"txt":"workplaces, and you very well may be"},{"t":161.7,"txt":"experiencing this yourself. Take this"},{"t":163.9,"txt":"IBM Canada study, for example, which"},{"t":166.4,"txt":"found [music] 79% of Canadian full-time"},{"t":169.1,"txt":"office workers report using AI tools"},{"t":171.6,"txt":"[music] at work, and 97% of those users"},{"t":175,"txt":"say that AI improves their productivity."},{"t":177.6,"txt":"But, that doesn't mean every workplace"},{"t":179.1,"txt":"is using AI as well as they could. So,"},{"t":181.8,"txt":"let's take a look at some action you can"},{"t":183.5,"txt":"take right now to set yourself up for"},{"t":185.4,"txt":"success. There's still a premium on the"},{"t":188,"txt":"human touch. In a recent report, the"},{"t":190.6,"txt":"Conference Board of Canada found that"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"social and emotional skills mattered"},{"t":194.9,"txt":"more in roles augmented by AI,"},{"t":197.4,"txt":"highlighting the value of the following"},{"t":199.2,"txt":"skills: ability to learn, analytical"},{"t":202.2,"txt":"skills, change management, critical"},{"t":204.9,"txt":"thinking, leadership, and problem"},{"t":207.2,"txt":"solving."},{"t":214.6,"txt":"Problem solved."},{"t":216.4,"txt":"In the same report, the board found the"},{"t":218.2,"txt":"top 10 AI augmenting roles with the"},{"t":220.6,"txt":"largest job postings growth are mainly"},{"t":223,"txt":"positions valuing creativity and"},{"t":225,"txt":"judgment. So, even in an increasingly"},{"t":228,"txt":"AI-filled world, those soft skills count"},{"t":230.6,"txt":"for a lot. These skills tend to stay"},{"t":232.6,"txt":"relevant [music] even as technology"},{"t":234.3,"txt":"changes and help future-proof your value"},{"t":236.8,"txt":"in the job marketplace. So, now you know"},{"t":239.1,"txt":"the landscape is changing and you're"},{"t":241,"txt":"aware of some crucial skills to help"},{"t":242.9,"txt":"position you as a strong candidate in an"},{"t":245.2,"txt":"AI-expanding world."},{"t":247.3,"txt":"But now what? Well,"},{"t":249,"txt":"in the spirit of Canadian hospitality,"},{"t":251.3,"txt":"here are some free, credible resources"},{"t":254,"txt":"designed to help people just like you"},{"t":256,"txt":"build AI and digital skills. Destination"},{"t":259,"txt":"AI is a free online course [music]"},{"t":261.1,"txt":"developed by CIFAR, one of Canada's"},{"t":263.4,"txt":"leading research institutes,"},{"t":265.3,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":265.5,"txt":">> that introduces core AI concepts in an"},{"t":267.8,"txt":"accessible way. You'll get familiar with"},{"t":269.7,"txt":"areas like deep learning and machine"},{"t":271.7,"txt":"learning and understand the difference."},{"t":274.4,"txt":"This program offers a certificate upon"},{"t":276.4,"txt":"completion. Upskill Canada connects job"},{"t":279,"txt":"seekers to training opportunities that"},{"t":280.8,"txt":"support career transitions into"},{"t":282.9,"txt":"in-demand [music] fields, including"},{"t":284.6,"txt":"digital and tech-adjacent roles."},{"t":286.7,"txt":"Workshops and virtual lessons are"},{"t":288.6,"txt":"everywhere now. And if you can invest,"},{"t":290.8,"txt":"they are a great way to get up to speed"},{"t":292.8,"txt":"on popular AI tools. The future of AI"},{"t":295.9,"txt":"and work isn't written yet, but staying"},{"t":298.1,"txt":"informed and building relevant skills,"},{"t":300.3,"txt":"now that is something you can control."},{"t":302.8,"txt":"Good luck, Canuck."},{"t":305.4,"txt":"For more insights on careers, job"},{"t":307.3,"txt":"trends, and practical job search advice,"},{"t":309.6,"txt":"and if you found this video helpful, be"},{"t":312,"txt":"sure to subscribe for more."},{"t":314.4,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":315.3,"txt":">> Can we finish on this like a wide shot?"}],"words":[{"t":2.96,"w":"60%"},{"t":3.84,"w":"of"},{"t":4,"w":"Canadian"},{"t":4.44,"w":"workers"},{"t":4.8,"w":"are"},{"t":4.96,"w":"in"},{"t":5.08,"w":"jobs"},{"t":5.44,"w":"that"},{"t":5.56,"w":"will"},{"t":5.64,"w":"be"},{"t":5.76,"w":"affected"},{"t":6.28,"w":"by"},{"t":6.56,"w":"AI,"},{"t":7.2,"w":"but"},{"t":7.92,"w":"